        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ffss81v8E6SzfuyoDxWx-81" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;li data-start=&quot;2855&quot; data-end=&quot;2922&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2858&quot; data-end=&quot;2922&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The client sends a voucher purchase request through API Gateway.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2923&quot; data-end=&quot;3005&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2926&quot; data-end=&quot;3005&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The Verification Lambda validates the blockchain transaction using Alchemy API.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3006&quot; data-end=&quot;3071&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3009&quot; data-end=&quot;3071&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;After confirmation, the voucher status is updated in DynamoDB.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3072&quot; data-end=&quot;3132&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3075&quot; data-end=&quot;3132&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;DynamoDB Streams captures the change event (CDC pattern).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3133&quot; data-end=&quot;3173&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3136&quot; data-end=&quot;3173&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The event is delivered to Amazon SQS.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3174&quot; data-end=&quot;3234&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3177&quot; data-end=&quot;3234&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The Processor Lambda consumes the message asynchronously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3235&quot; data-end=&quot;3265&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3238&quot; data-end=&quot;3265&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The QR Code API is invoked.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;3266&quot; data-end=&quot;3305&quot; style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3305&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The generated asset is stored in S3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="270" width="450" x="120" y="910" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
